# Frame generation phase 0 (rexglue-frame-generation.patch), run with
# --frame_generation=fsr: a steady drive, the F4 settings overlay (an ImGui
# drawer) open through a forced 3 s stall of the guest output thread (UI overlay
# painting suspended, then resumed) and a fullscreen switch (a resize), then the
# overlay closed and an HDR switch. devrun.py --presentmon --present-log; read
# with presents.py: presents per swap, per segment.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 5s
mark steady
trigger rt 0.5
stick lx 0.15
wait 20s
key F4
mark overlay
wait 15s
set present_debug_stall_ms 3000
mark stall
wait 6s
mark after_stall
wait 8s
set fullscreen true
mark fullscreen
wait 6s
set fullscreen false
mark windowed
wait 6s
key F4
mark overlay_off
wait 6s
set hdr off
mark hdr_off
wait 6s
set hdr on
mark hdr_on
wait 6s
release all
mark end
wait 1s
